	(lib_symbols)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES - USB DEV\n\nDEV DOMAIN - powered from Dev USB-C VBUS via LDO (3V3_DEV). Must not back-power target.\nDev USB-C receptacle (UFP, 5.1k Rd on CC) -> ESD -> USB2514B 4-port hub (24 MHz xtal).\n  Port1: P4 USB-Serial/JTAG\n  Port2: C5 USB-Serial/JTAG\n  Port3: FT2232H (A = P4 UART0 + DTR/RTS auto-reset, B = C5 UART0 + auto-reset)\n  Port4: RP2040 + QSPI flash running STOCK ADSBee 1421 Programmer firmware (power-up check/reflash to its baked image - keep it = module fw version):\n         USB-serial to m1421 console, RTS -> DEV_SYNC, DTR -> ~SRST pulse (open-drain); 0R links (fitted) in both - remove for console-only, GPIO -> m1421 RX mux select.\n         Works with the ADSBee web console AT terminal + firmware uploader.\nAll Dev->target signals through Ioff buffers powered from the target side (SN74LVC2T45 / 74LVC1G07 / 74LVC1G125); target-side pull-downs on DEV_SYNC and mux select."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
